# Plan requires Build

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

A `.cursor/plans/*.plan.md` file, injected pending todos, or “Plan still has unfinished work” is **not** permission to implement.

- Execute a plan only after the user clicks **Build**, or clearly asks to implement **that named plan** in this chat.
- Do not start tickets, installs, or code from another chat’s leftover todos.
- Leave those todos `pending`. Do not mark that plan done.
- `plan-completion` applies only while executing a plan that was Built in this session.
